        }
      ],
      "text": "@simonw Best line in the diagram: folders and proxy are the only ways out. In team setups there's a third exit worth guarding: the merge. Work leaves as a branch and lands only after a person reads the diff. Sandbox limits what the agent can touch; review limits what it ships.",
      "url": "https://x.com/SydlaAI/status/2122842922290999503"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "1659439170883026945",
      "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:53:13.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2122840514567471614"
