        {
          "id": "2122500307557265651",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "@simonw The allow-list proxy is the piece I'd want first. In February I wrote about a Meta AI security researcher whose agent deleted her inbox and ignored her stop commands from her phone, and limits outside the agent are what that story was missing.",
      "url": "https://x.com/jackrudenko/status/2122840514567471614"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "2035042022307049472",
      "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:41:55.000Z",
