      "text": "@TimBorovkov @simonw Same wish here, it's why I'm building https://t.co/w8THWdLsYl. The agent gets its own machine in the cloud, with a desktop, and it keeps going when the laptop is closed. Opens in December. What would it need on day one for you to move?",
