      "text": "@simonw Simon, the useful part is the pattern: the agent stays on the Mac, and the code runs in one of 3 sandboxes, WebAssembly, QEMU or an Apple container.\n\nAn HTTP allow-list is the control I would require before any of those agents touch a client file.",
      "url": "https://x.com/mikeelliott/status/2122801655800361299"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "1898811925892403200",
      "created_at": "2026-11-17T21:15:37.000Z",
