      ],
      "text": "@simonw Really useful write-up. \nThe sandbox stops the agent from wrecking the laptop, but in most companies the bigger blast radius is the API token sitting in the environment, since that reaches the CRM or ERP no matter where the code runs. Have you tried pairing the external sandbox",
      "url": "https://x.com/GuttmanIta76973/status/2122800852494680504"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "121778026",
