      ],
      "text": "@simonw The detail I'd copy first is the verb rule, not the host list. Your example gives https://t.co/LP6qEbYdlK GET only, with the token added by the proxy. So code in the box can read issues but can't push or comment, even with a real token behind it.\n\nHost lists stop leaks to",
      "url": "https://x.com/DrJunaidFarooq/status/2122799601698644053"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "2122791331474886656",
