      ],
      "text": "@simonw I went the other way for my voice agent: Claude Code on the host, real creds, a PreToolUse hook as the gate. Reads pass. Anything irreversible is read back as one sentence and only runs after a spoken yes.\n\nYour credential replacement trick is the bit I'd steal.",
      "url": "https://x.com/MarkWesterweel/status/2122798178315407633"
